{
"version": "1",
"text": "This look brings you a soft, autumnal warmth that feels perfectly suited for an evening vocal lesson. The beige dress with its structured puff sleeves creates a lovely silhouette, while the light grey cardigan adds a gentle layer of texture and comfort. Topping it off with the graphite headband gives your hair a polished finish that complements your makeup without being overwhelming.",
"how_to_wear": [
"The belt on the dress defines your waistline to draw attention upward, highlighting your shoulders."
],
